# `mrs @R@, tpidr_el0` (rseq::thread_pointer's aarch64 asm, and the third
# instruction of every TLS sequence; verus/seams/rseq-thread_pointer.md):
# it writes only its destination, with TPIDR_EL0, reads
# and writes no memory, leaves the flags and falls through. run.sh
# prepends the insn line.
writes @R@
no-mem-write
flags-preserved
mem-reads 0
assert (= final.@R@ init.TPIDR_EL0)
assert (= final._PC (bvadd init._PC #x0000000000000004))
